sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as MainWindow 主线程
    participant Cache as _books_cache
    participant Worker as BookQueryWorker 工作线程
    participant DB as books_information.db
    participant Model as CoverCardModel
    participant View as QListView

    UI->>UI: refresh_view()
    UI->>Cache: 检查缓存时间

    alt 缓存有效
        Cache-->>UI: 返回缓存数据
        UI->>Model: set_books(cached_books)
    else 缓存不存在或已过期
        UI->>Worker: trigger_fetch.emit()
        Worker->>DB: 创建独立 SQLite 连接
        Worker->>DB: SELECT * FROM books_information
        DB-->>Worker: fetchall() 返回 list[tuple]
        Worker->>UI: books_ready.emit(result)
        UI->>Cache: 保存查询结果和时间戳
        UI->>Model: set_books(result)
    end

    Model->>Model: beginResetModel()
    Model->>Model: 将元组转换成字典
    Model->>Model: 保存到 _books
    Model->>Model: endResetModel()
    Model-->>View: 数据已重置
    View->>Model: rowCount()
    Model-->>View: 返回书籍数量
    View->>Model: data(index, role)
    Model-->>View: 返回书名、作者、类型等数据